{"id":"n85148-1-9","stage":4,"title":"해답 · 解答","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85148-1-9-1","ko":"그 수학 문제 어렵지 않았어?","zh":"那道数学题难吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그","meaning":"那样，那个","explanation":"그：那样，那个","readings":[{"term":"그","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62250","senseId":"2","lemma":"그","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"수학","meaning":"数学","explanation":"수학：数学","readings":[{"term":"수학","audio":"/audio/5c67e8578836de397afd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64718","senseId":"1","lemma":"수학","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제","meaning":"题，问题","explanation":"문제：题，问题","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"1","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어렵지","meaning":"难，不容易","explanation":"어렵다：难，不容易；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"어렵다","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62232","senseId":"1","lemma":"어렵다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않았어?","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71583","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"38c61820e786f234","term":"그","zh":"那样，那个","audio":"/audio/38c61820e786f2346e96.mp3","entryId":"62250","definition":"指代前面已经讲过或听话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["그"]},{"id":"5c67e8578836de39","term":"수학","zh":"数学","audio":"/audio/5c67e8578836de397afd.mp3","entryId":"64718","definition":"关于算数或空间测量等数和量的学问。","pronunciation":["수ː학"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"题，问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"要求解答的题目。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"55d0f08434308816","term":"어렵다","zh":"难，不容易","audio":"/audio/55d0f08434308816bcaf.mp3","entryId":"62232","definition":"做起来复杂或费力。","pronunciation":["어렵따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"71583","definition":"用于否定前文所指的状态。","pronunciation":["안타"]}],"audio":"/audio/191b637dc691708eee27.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n85148-1-9-2","ko":"응, 해답을 봤는데도 잘 이해가 안 가.","zh":"嗯，就算看了答案也还是不太明白。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"해답을","meaning":"解答，答案","explanation":"해답：解答，答案；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"해답","audio":"/audio/2220669487fae67f977e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85148","senseId":"1","lemma":"해답","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봤는데도","meaning":"照，看","explanation":"보다：照，看；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"25","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"很好地，熟练地","explanation":"잘：很好地，熟练地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"1","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"이해가","meaning":"理解，领悟","explanation":"이해：理解，领悟；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"이해","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69533","senseId":"1","lemma":"이해","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가.","meaning":"理解、领会（이해가 가다：能理解）","explanation":"가다：理解、领会（이해가 가다：能理解）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"24","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"2220669487fae67f","term":"해답","zh":"解答，答案","audio":"/audio/2220669487fae67f977e.mp3","entryId":"85148","definition":"回答问题或算出答案；或指那种回答。","pronunciation":["해ː답"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"照，看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"为了了解某对象的内容或状态而进行观察。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"很好地，熟练地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"熟悉而擅长地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"da2995a8c183c1ca","term":"이해","zh":"理解，领悟","audio":"/audio/da2995a8c183c1cabd41.mp3","entryId":"69533","definition":"顿悟到而明白；或指十分了解而接受。","pronunciation":["이ː해"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"理解、领会（이해가 가다：能理解）","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"理解、领会（이해가 가다：能理解）","pronunciation":["가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cbbcf0b5e34f7e6963ba.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=85148","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":138,"sequenceScore":2.6997,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，就算看了答案也还是不太明白。","那道数学题难吗？","我很快就会变成世界上最富有的那个人了。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["那道数学题难吗？","我很快就会变成世界上最富有的那个人了。","嗯，就算看了答案也还是不太明白。"],"answer":2}]}
